{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast, crazy boomer shooter where mutant hamster-men kidnap you.. and regret it. Bust out of their creepy underground lab with big guns, smash through their evil plans, and turn every furry freak into bloody chunks on your way to freedom. Turn their underground lab into a blood soaked horror\u2026 and these twisted rodents have a <i>lot</i> to answer for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hamster Hunter you can navigate through <strong>unique levels</strong> earning <strong>points</strong> and trying to top your own <strong>high scores</strong>. Earn blood vials from the blood on the Hamsters to purchase new <strong>weapons</strong>. Battle <strong>several unique enemy types</strong> as well as <strong>bosses</strong>. Take on the challenge to <strong>speed run</strong> the levels with a built in speed run timer to try and get a S on all levels for a special reward. Do you have what it takes?<br><strong></strong><br><strong>Basic Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival Mode (Horde Mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ Unique enemy types and boss enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in speed run timers to get your best score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score tracking along with a intuitive grading system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Unique Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Unique Executions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486050/extras/c086e98142c5205e2bbdb8fc31626d29.poster.avif?t=1767399037\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486050/extras/c086e98142c5205e2bbdb8fc31626d29.webm?t=1767399037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"htt